# es\cosmo\graveyard\enc_graveyard_patrols1.es
#
# The patrol beacons of the graveyard: two hotspots a player uses to take a
# patrol mission, which cosmo_patrols_1 hands out. They are up from the
# bundle's load and stay up; the controller takes each use and the beacon is
# ready again.
#
# Retail 2.3.1's graveyard beacons (bundle BE267CBF, two) came up with the
# bubble and gave both kill missions.

@activity_bundle("enc_graveyard_patrols1")

patrol_terminal patrol_terminal
patrol_terminal patrol_terminal_1
